{"content":[{"c":["ADIN"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Ancestor of a group of people who returned to Judah with Zerubbabel after the Babylonian exile. Comparison of various lists (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.15","r":"Ezra.2.15","rawR":"Ezra.2.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.15","value":"Ezra.2.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:15"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.6","r":"Ezra.8.6","rawR":"Ezra.8.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.6","value":"Ezra.8.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"8:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.20","r":"Neh.7.20","rawR":"Neh.7.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.20","value":"Neh.7.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Esd.5.14","r":"1Esd.5.14","rawR":"1Esd.5.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Esd.5.14","value":"1Esd.5.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Esd 5:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Esd.8.32","r":"1Esd.8.32","rawR":"1Esd.8.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Esd.8.32","value":"1Esd.8.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"8:32"},") shows that groups of Adin’s descendants returned at different times."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Political leader who signed Ezra’s covenant of faithfulness to God with Nehemiah and others after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.16","r":"Neh.10.16","rawR":"Neh.10.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.16","value":"Neh.10.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:16"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Adin","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.15","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.15","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.15"},{"anchorText":"8:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.8.6","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.8.6","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.8.6"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.20","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.20","sourceRefExact